{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/STORE_ASSETS___NEW___Store_Page_Banneer_Mobile_HD_additional.jpg?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What if WWII never really ended?</strong> In <i>War Mechanic</i>, the world\u2019s greatest war drags into the 50s under a new set of rules\u2014commercial ones. With the Nazis gone, old Allies turn into new enemies, fueling a conflict driven by profit and power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As <strong>Jack Wallace</strong>, a sharp-witted mechanic caught in the middle of this privatized war effort, you take charge of a rundown <strong>US Army repair base</strong> on the isolated island of <strong>Nordhook</strong>\u2014deep within contested territory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission? <strong>Turn scrap into cutting-edge war tech, rebuild your base, and help allies progress in the front.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore, scavenge, craft, automate,</strong> and <strong>fight</strong> your way\u00a0while uncovering the island\u2019s turbulent past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/hands_on.png?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/hands_on_mechanics_v2.gif?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scrap resources, repair military equipment, and fulfill high-stakes military contracts. Every dollar counts in this <strong>high-risk, high-reward</strong> war economy and can be invested in your base upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/explore.png?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/explogif.gif?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into Nordhook\u2019s open environment and investigate abandoned bunkers and battle-scarred landscapes. <strong>What did the previous hosts leave behind?</strong><i>\u00a0</i>Utilize the workshop to upgrade your ride and explore the island on wheels.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/base_defence___automation.png?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/paj\u0105k.gif?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rebuild and automate your base so you can defend against the air rides, unlock new blueprints that will allow you to construct new weapons and tools, unlock personal perks, and invent story-driven tech upgrades. <i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/dieselpunk.png?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/dieselpunk.gif?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic WWII war machines like the <strong>Willys Jeep, M4 Sherman, and CCKW Hardtop</strong> meet futuristic, automated combat technology. History collides with industry in a gritty, alternate \u201850s reality recreated in Unreal 5!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/simple.png?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/Simple_economy_v2.gif?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juggle cash flow, resource management, and production efficiency. Make smart deals, but remember\u2014<strong>wars aren\u2019t won for free.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/alternative.png?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/kolosus.gif?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A failed nuclear test reshaped global politics, pushing the USSR and USA into another all-out war. Inspired by real historical figures like\u00a0<strong>General George Patton</strong>\u00a0and concepts like the\u00a0<strong>G.I. Bill</strong>,\u00a0<i>War Mechanic</i>\u00a0delivers a gripping story with conspiracies lurking beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2861090?t=1744972531","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/33f7077d05ec75e1afe62b02250af3973662f7e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744972531","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/4982e91ddcc2b8ac0f258bbc66d9c5562581d59b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744972531","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/4982e91ddcc2b8ac0f258bbc66d9c5562581d59b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744972531","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse