 efficiency. Make smart deals, but remember\u2014<strong>wars aren\u2019t won for free.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/alternative.png?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/extras/kolosus.gif?t=1744972531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A failed nuclear test reshaped global politics, pushing the USSR and USA into another all-out war. Inspired by real historical figures like\u00a0<strong>General George Patton</strong>\u00a0and concepts like the\u00a0<strong>G.I. Bill</strong>,\u00a0<i>War Mechanic</i>\u00a0delivers a gripping story with conspiracies lurking beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Chronospace"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861090/74cc06b7f19756f6078b07e7032a190dc677e79c/header.jpg?t=1744972531","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257041633,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257041633/movie480.mp4?t=1744012241","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257041633/movie_max.mp4?t=1744012241"},"name":"War Mechanic Announcement Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257041633/0f36d31e0c1d8969f52ca5e3a93abf81cdda320c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744012241","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257041633/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744012241","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257041633/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744012241"}}],"name":"War Mechanic","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>